Package: Multisplit
Title: Splits a dataset into training and test sets across multiple binary outcomes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Joana", "Martins", , "joana.ventura87@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The algorithm attempts to simultaneously balance fold sizes, the distribution of positive cases across outcomes, and the distribution of cases with multiple positive outcomes.
